WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.370
Once in America, Mitsuki
is reunited with Ms. Kazumi,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.870
who gives her the address of her contact
who may know how to find Eichi.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.970
Mitsuki is so excited to be
on the verge of finding Eichi,

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.940
and both her throat checkup
and visit to the TV studio go well.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.800
No keywords have appeared
in the Death Spirit Handbook.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.240
Looks like this is
going to be a great trip!

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.900
So, I wonder what's going to
happen today...

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.700
Got that?

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:29.700
Yes.

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:12.540
Thank you so very much
for everything.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.440
No problem. Be careful.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.440
Take care, Mitsuki.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.340
Yes, Ms. Kazumi.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:23.640
Now we're finally free from babysitting.
Right, Takuto?

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.300
Huh? Yeah, that's right.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:33.040
What's the matter, Takuto?
You're sad about leaving that kid, huh?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.970
Bye bye, Nick!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.200
Thank you for everything.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.870
I'm definitely going to see Eichi!

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:52.800
And this time I will definitely
tell him how I feel!

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:17.600
Oh, I feel so free now that
we're without the baby!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.870
Really, what's been up with you?

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:26.300
W-What?

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.270
You're acting a little strange today!

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:31.540
I-I'm not acting strange.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.670
<i>I'm not acting strange.</i>
<i>It's only natural.</i>

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.970
<i>She's a human and</i>
<i>I'm a Death Spirit.</i>

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:46.570
<i>Even if I could communicate my feelings,</i>
<i>what would happen?</i>

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:56.140
<i>I can't make her happy.</i>
<i>And...she likes Eichi.</i>

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:06.070
<i>There's no need for me.</i>
<i>That's right. It's only natural!</i>

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.340
It looks like there's time
until the next bus.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.170
So, what should we do?

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:32.970
Huh?

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.740
Do you even need to ask?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.640
Sightseeing!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.270
All right. Time to make
some dough for today.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:00.970
We're here!

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.100
Wow!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.870
It's amazing!

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.870
That's Eagle Valley!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.470
Come on! Let's ride that
down to the valley floor.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:18.400
Wow!
Ms. Oshige, I wanna go too!

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:21.870
What? You too?
But you can't go alone.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:27.300
You really don't get it!
It'll be fine since I'll be with her!

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.170
Stupid! That's what worries us!

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:35.470
I see, Takuto is going too. Then there's
nothing to worry about, I guess.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.140
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:40.500
Thank you, Ms. Oshige.
Let's go, Takuto.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:41.300
All right.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.740
Hey, wait!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:49.070
Whoops!

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:57.740
I'm so sorry!

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.670
Wow...

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.840
It's like a Baumkuchen.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:24.440
Yeah, I wonder how long
it takes to get like this?

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.040
Ahem!

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:32.200
This is called a "stratum," and it takes
approximately 43,000 years to form.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:35.870
This dramatic gorge formation
started two billion years ago,

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:38.100
and the erosion
continues to this day.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:41.200
Oh, is that so?
You know so much, Meroko!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:42.340
Ahem!

00:06:42.740 --> 00:06:44.700
Hmm, I wonder.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:46.070
W-What?

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:48.200
Are you just making stuff up again?

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:53.270
How rude! It's not made up.
I'm just relaying what's in here!

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:58.200
But nature can be really huge!
Oh, I know.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.000
Let's take a picture since we're here.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.840
That's a good idea!

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:03.740
Yeah!

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.240
Do you want me to
take the photo for you?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:09.700
Huh?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.400
You can't take a souvenir photo
by yourself, can you?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.540
Here, give me it to me.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.140
Oh, yes, please.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.600
All right, Takuto, Meroko.

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.300
Okay?

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.500
- Yeah.
- Yup.

00:07:31.540 --> 00:07:33.240
Are you ready, young lady?

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.470
Yes!

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:43.570
<i>It's a cheap and worthless necklace,</i>
<i>but I'll make it the start to my work here.</i>

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:48.570
All right, smile!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.340
Thank you very much.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:57.070
Don't mention it.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:09.040
I'm sorry, are you all right?

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.100
Y-Yes.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:11.700
All right then.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.770
Thank you.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.470
Mitsuki, shouldn't we be
going back soon?

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.100
Yeah, we should.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:36.000
It's gone.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.870
What's the matter, Mitsuki?

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.070
It's gone! It's gone!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.440
What's gone?

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.270
The pendant is gone!

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.570
What am I gonna do?!
Without that... Without that...

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:50.140
Calm down!
Calm down, Mitsuki!

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.600
What should we do, Takuto?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.600
Well, we won't make it in time
if we don't go back now.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:01.970
Takuto, Meroko, you guys go back first!
I'll stay here and look for it.

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.670
I'll go back after I find it!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:06.470
You know we can't do that!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:11.040
B-But... Without it...

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.200
What should we do?

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.400
Is it that important?

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:21.970
All right, I know.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.870
Mitsuki and I will stay here
and look for the pendant.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:30.770
What?!

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.870
Hey Takuto! Are you serious?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:39.700
Yeah. So you go up and let them
know about this. Let's go, Mitsuki.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.170
J-J-Just a minute!

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:56.200
Why am I left behind again?!
Jeez! Forget them!

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.640
It left.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:08.040
I wonder what happened
to Mitsuki and them.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.570
You don't think they've gotten in
an accident or something, do you?!

00:10:12.870 --> 00:10:14.100
Let's go look for them.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:20.440
Even though I said what I said,
I just can't leave them on their own.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:25.740
Why am I so admirable?
And that idiot Takuto...

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:29.600
Lucky! Perfect timing!

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.400
Hey! It's awful, just awful!

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.440
Hey, are you listening?
I said, it's awful!

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.040
Oh yeah...

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.300
So that's what happened.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.070
Really, Meroko?

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:43.840
Yup.

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:46.900
Then we need to hurry
down to get them.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.540
You're right, let's hurry.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.200
You had it on when
we took the picture, right?

00:11:00.900 --> 00:11:01.570
Yeah.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:10.570
Let's look for it again
on the route here.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:12.570
Come on.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:16.340
There's no use getting depressed, right?
Let's look for it.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:18.700
Yeah.

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.900
Let's go back to where
we took the photo again.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.600
Takuto...

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.400
Please!

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:45.200
As I've said, all the drivers
have gone home for the night,

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.070
and there's no way
we can operate it.

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.240
No way!

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.500
Isn't there some way?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.870
I'll go.

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:54.970
Axel...

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.100
Will you be all right, Axel?

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:19.900
Thank you so very much!

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.200
Leave it to me!

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.470
It's not here after all.
We don't need to look anymore, Takuto.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:41.700
I'm sorry.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.770
Hey, you're giving up so easily?

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:47.770
Well, it's already so late.

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.100
It's something important to you, right?

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.440
Yeah.

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:58.500
Eichi gave me that pendant.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:00.670
O-Oh, I see!

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:04.000
But it's all right!

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:07.670
Because I get to see him soon!

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:11.470
It's too bad I lost it,
but it's all right!

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:13.040
B-But...

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.870
We've already made Ms. Oshige
and the others worry, so let's go back.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.170
Takuto, thanks for
looking for it with me!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.540
What?! This is terrible!

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:32.500
Takuto, what do we do?

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.240
I guess there's no choice.
I'll carry you and fly up.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:42.370
Are you Mitsuki?

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:45.270
Huh? Oh, yes.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:48.600
Huh?

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.700
No.
Don't come any closer!

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.270
All right, let's go.

00:13:55.570 --> 00:13:56.570
I don't want to!

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.400
Hey, you!

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.340
Get away from Mitsuki!

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.500
Oh, there's someone with her.

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:06.770
Takuto!

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:08.840
What are you planning
to do with Mitsuki?!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:12.270
I wasn't planning to do anything.
You come with us too.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.270
Now, hurry up.

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:24.640
Wow, it's like a Western!

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:27.000
It's from the pioneering days.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.670
Thank you very much.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.400
Sorry for surprising you earlier.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:38.940
No, sorry for jumping to conclusions
even though you had come to rescue us.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:41.070
It was a pretty good tackle.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.170
After we eat, we'll sleep.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:45.770
We'll go back first thing
tomorrow morning.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.440
Okay!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.900
We'll look for your lost item
again tomorrow.

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:21.240
Takuto?

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:32.570
Man, I'm such a loser!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.270
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:15:34.340 --> 00:15:37.970
<i>What am I supposed to do?</i>
<i>At this rate, I'll eventually...</i>

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.000
Takuto?

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:46.540
S-Stupid!
It's dangerous to walk around alone!

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.200
S-Sorry.

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:52.240
But since you went out,
I followed you!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:57.870
Can I sit down?

00:15:58.370 --> 00:15:59.040
Yeah.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:05.700
I'm sorry.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:06.900
About what?

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.800
For not being able to
find your pendant.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.540
No, it's really all right.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:15.800
You looked really hard
for it too, Takuto.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:19.740
Hey, Takuto?

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:20.540
Huh?

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:25.240
I'm really glad that I met you, Takuto.

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:26.000
What?

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:28.440
Because I met you,
I was able to become a singer.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.270
And I was able to come
all the way to America.

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:34.200
I didn't think I'd be able see Eichi again,
but I'm gonna get to see him soon too.

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:40.340
Even though sometimes when
I talk about Eichi, you get moody.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.970
Th-That's...

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:47.300
But whatever happens, you're always
on my side, and you always help me.

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.140
Th-That's...

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.140
Why?

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:52.300
What?

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:55.740
Why do you always
do so much for me?

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:59.640
Th-That's...
That's because...

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:10.840
That's because you're a little loser,
and you can't take care of yourself!

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:11.540
What?

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.240
I'm going back!

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:17.670
Wait for me, Takuto!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:38.100
I wish we had a better
hideout than this.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.300
Oh, good morning, Eric.

00:17:42.570 --> 00:17:45.400
Did you guys drink all night?

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:48.970
Get it together!
We need to make some dough today too!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.240
Oh?
That guy...

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.300
What's the matter, Eric?

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:06.200
O-Oh no!
Run!

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:09.100
That man... I think he's...

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.570
Just as I thought!
He's the thief that targets tourists!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.140
I see! So she didn't
drop the pendant!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.970
He stole it back then!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:23.670
Huh?

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.000
Otherwise, he wouldn't run away!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:28.600
W-Wait!

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:34.940
Wait!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.570
I can't keep going!

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:41.170
M-Me neither.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:46.700
Wait!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.840
- What?
- Huh?

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.100
- We've been spared.
- We've been spared.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:08.800
You can't get away now!

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:13.170
All right!
Give us back the pendant!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:26.400
Takuto!

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:28.270
What're you gonna do?

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:32.040
A-All right. I'll give it back,
so forgive me!

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:34.970
Here you go!

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.500
Damn it!

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:47.800
Takuto!

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.340
What an idiot.

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:07.170
Takuto! Takuto!

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:12.300
What do I do?
Takuto is... Takuto is...

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.070
What're you crying for,
you little loser?

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.300
You're so stupid, Takuto!

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.770
Takuto?

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:33.970
Stupid, stupid!
You're so stupid, Takuto!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:38.000
What the... I got it back for you!
Aren't you happy?!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.600
I am happy! But why did you
do such a reckless thing?!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:46.500
When I go back to this form, I can fly,
and besides, Death Spirits can't die!

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:50.340
That's not the point!
I was worried!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:53.140
Takuto, where are you?

00:20:54.700 --> 00:21:00.040
Why? Why do you always act so tough?
You did such a dangerous thing!

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.900
Oh, enough, enough!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:04.100
Answer me, Takuto!

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:05.670
Why should I, you little loser?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.900
What did you say?!

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.740
Takuto!

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:17.770
I-It's... It's because I like you,
of course!

00:23:05.970 --> 00:23:10.340
Hey, Takuto, what are you doing
telling her you like her?!

00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:12.300
Gosh, you're so annoying!

00:23:12.340 --> 00:23:14.740
Don't call me annoying!

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:19.800
Takuto, you're a Death Spirit and
she's a human! It's forbidden!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.740
And... And...

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:24.600
Eichi's gonna be in
the picture soon too,right?

00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:26.470
You don't have to tell me twice!

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:31.170
Next time on Full Moon:
"To the Town Where Eichi Lives!"

00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:32.570
- Look forward to it!
- Look forward to it!
